1. Deployment mission: encounter 44, ordinary production Works setup, six seconds; control changes only Center approach to North. Eight unique initial goals, every goal outside the origin, adjacent centre lanes separated by at least 15 m after geometry resolution. Exactly one mission_initialised per squad; mission stable absent a received higher order. Actual task orders/receipts, with ordinary report/reaction latency. North changes Azure lane goals but not Ember's.
