4. Reserves: appended platoon encounter, production situation reports and orders; reserve/consolidate goals within own reported sector, versus changed squad deployment lane. Occupied candidate skipped; mover lane does not determine reserve lane. Paired controls alter only the tested stimulus; direct contract checks supplement, never replace, physical scenarios.

